[2026-05-24] Box-diffusion pipeline I5 — EDM Heun sampler + BoxAPMetric

- src/decoders/diffusion/box_set.py: `edm_sigma_schedule` static helper
  (Karras et al., trailing 0 for clean output). `BoxSetDiffusionDecoder.sample`
  EDM Heun sampler on the x₀-prediction parameterisation. Single-step
  (`num_inference_steps=1`) returns the σ_max forward pass directly; multi-step
  does Euler + Heun corrector. Defaults: σ_min=0.002, σ_max=1.0, ρ=7.0.
